                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 12]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the United States Delegation on Article
                        22</hi></head>
                <p>The Greek Delegation moved an amendment to permit Greek nationals having property
                    in Bulgaria to enter Bulgaria for the administration or disposal of their
                    property.</p>
                <p>The U.S. Delegation did not feel that such compulsory right of entry was
                    necessarily related to the restoration and/or compensation of United Nations
                    property in Bulgaria and that the real interests of Greek nationals were
                    adequately protected by the provisions of Article 22 as drafted.</p>
            </div>
